     "end": 12.427,
     "lineId": "c01-s02-l3"
    },
    {
     "lines": [
      "そして、肌に触れるものを使うこと"
     ],
     "start": 12.977,
     "end": 16.046,
     "lineId": "c01-s02-l4"
    },
    {
     "lines": [
